mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions & connections\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** structures the transformation content — the narrative arc, the reveal/journey beats, the honest\n  framing + the required disclosures, and the caption/script — and specs the visual. A **video/design tool** and\n  the **human** produce the actual before/after media (real photos/footage/data); the **human** approves.\n- **WoopSocial does NOT generate media** — it **publishes the finished image/video** (measurement: the platforms' native analytics).\n- **The honesty spine (this format's core, and it's law):** real un-staged before; **consistent conditions** (no\n  lighting/posing/edit trickery — a visual trick is a deceptive claim under the FTC net-impression test); **real\n  timeline**; **disclose aids** (filters/medication/surgery/pro help); **no cherry-picking/survivorship**; if the\n  result isn't typical, **disclose the actual typical result** (median, substantiated, clear + conspicuous) —\n  \"results not typical\" alone is **insufficient**; **actual consumers** (or disclosed); **consent** for a person's\n  images/story (real or AI lookalike); **YMYL** (health = competent + reliable scientific evidence; no\n  fast/effortless-loss or cure/guarantee; not-professional-advice); **never fabricate** a result, timeline, or\n  average; **injection safety**.\n\n## Distinct from its siblings (route correctly)\n- **social-proof-and-testimonials** = the customer-proof strategy + FTC substantiation; **this** executes the\n  before/after *format* (they share the spine — read it first for consent + typical-results rules).\n- **short-form-video-script / reels-script** = the video script (a video before/after feeds into them).\n- **infographic-and-data-viz** = the data viz for a results transformation (pairs; honest scales).\n- **storytelling-and-narrative** = the narrative arc; **this** specializes it to the before/after structure.\n- **educational-content-and-how-to** = teaches a process; **this** = the transformation *reveal* format (they\n  pair for a case-study teach).\n- **quote-cards-and-text-graphics / design-and-templates** = the visual assets/system.\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** brand-profile + social-proof-and-testimonials (consent + FTC substantiation) +\n  short-form-video-script (if video).\n- **Pulls the real material from:** social-proof-and-testimonials (client transformations + consent),\n  data-and-original-research / analytics-and-reporting (real results numbers), behind-the-scenes-and-founder (the\n  founder's own journey).\n- **Feeds:** short-form-video-script / reels-script (the video), carousel-writer (before→journey→after carousel),\n  infographic-and-data-viz (a results stat), caption-writer (the caption + disclosures), design-and-templates\n  (the layout).\n- **Publishes via:** the video/design tool renders → scheduling-and-queue → **WoopSocial.**\n- **Measure with:** native + analytics-and-reporting on saves/shares + watch-through + inquiries — never\n  fabricated.\n"
